*** After a two-level overcall

`1M-(2m)-` is a simple overcall of a lower minor over a major opening, `1X-(2Y)-`
(`Y` above `X`) a jump overcall; the remaining simple two-level overcalls,
1!s-(2!h) and 1!d-(2!c), are written out.

